    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703120/extras/1ffcca2d5ec700dc2221939e0fd25e59.avif?t=1752709790\" width=600 height=95 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You finally checked into the legendary Hardcastle\u2026 and someone pulled a dirty trick on you! Your precious Bara card collection has been scattered all over the place \u2014 hidden by a mystery man with a <i>very</i> playful sense of humor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now it\u2019s up to you to explore the castle hotel room by room and sniff out your missing cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search behind tapestries, inside treasure chests, under silky bedsheets, and in all the <i>suspicious</i> places a naughty knight might stash something.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock steamy illustrations and slowly rebuild your hard-earned collection, one musclebound card at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready for a cheeky, ripped, and ridiculously fun scavenger hunt? Only true Bara lovers can recover every last card!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703120/extras/815389906135c62a2fa231b77fe03979.avif?t=1752709790\" width=600 height=97 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0100 Sensual Cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 Interactive Medieval Rooms </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with One Hand </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controller Support</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703120/extras/1ffcca2d5ec700dc2221939e0fd25e59.avif?t=1752709790\" width=600 height=95 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You finally checked into the legendary Hardcastle\u2026 and someone pulled a dirty trick on you! Your precious Bara card collection has been scattered all over the place \u2014 hidden by a mystery man with a <i>very</i> playful sense of humor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now it\u2019s up to you to explore the castle hotel room by room and sniff out your missing cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search behind tapestries, inside treasure chests, under silky bedsheets, and in all the <i>suspicious</i> places a naughty knight might stash something.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock steamy illustrations and slowly rebuild your hard-earned collection, one musclebound card at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready for a cheeky, ripped, and ridiculously fun scavenger hunt? Only true Bara lovers can recover every last card!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703120/extras/815389906135c62a2fa231b77fe03979.avif?t=1752709790\" width=600 height=97 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0100 Sensual Cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 Interactive Medieval Rooms </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with One Hand </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controller Support</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Someone scattered your precious Bara deck all over the castle hotel! Search every corner \u2014 behind curtains, inside chests, even in suspiciously steamy spots. Explore 3D medieval rooms, unlock sensual art, and complete your muscle-packed collection in this cheeky, spicy hunt!",
